# Polymorphic NDJSON and JSON arrays (minified and pretty-printed) with `arrow.json` columns:
# strings in `arrow.json` columns are stored quoted as raw JSON text, numbers unquoted with exact
# digits (including integers outside `i64`), and nested objects/arrays have insignificant whitespace
# removed while preserving spaces inside strings.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../data/json/poly.ndjson' | sort by id asc;
from '../../data/json/minified_array.json' | sort by id asc;
from '../../data/json/pretty_array.json' | sort by id asc
---- expected
id   | pkg                                 | scripts                 | tags      | score  | code    | big_id
long | dynamic                             | dynamic                 | dynamic   | real   | dynamic | dynamic
-----+-------------------------------------+-------------------------+-----------+--------+---------+---------------------
   1 | {"scripts":"scripts.yaml"}          | "scripts.yaml"          | "core"    |    1.0 | 42      | 18446744073709551615
   2 | {"scripts":{"build":"cargo build"}} | {"build":"cargo build"} | ["a","b"] |    2.5 | "ok"    | 9223372036854775808
   3 | null                                | null                    | null      | null   | null    | null

